  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39836468",
      "title": "Styling the Sidebar & Button with Tailwind CSS",
      "sourceHash": "59dc6140276f5a2425889e325e4632113d157d5d3db52f05ce5ec159242f4231",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.78,
          "end": 2.58,
          "en": "Now to style this application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.58,
          "end": 4.56,
          "en": "I'll start in this app component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.56,
          "end": 7.38,
          "en": "And add some CSS classes here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 7.38,
          "end": 8.213,
          "en": "And in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 8.213,
          "end": 13.1,
          "en": "I want to add the h-screen class provided by Tailwind CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.95,
          "end": 15,
          "en": "which simply makes sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 15,
          "end": 18.043,
          "en": "that this takes up all the screen height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 18.043,
          "end": 21.18,
          "en": "so that in the end the sidebar will then also",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 21.18,
          "end": 23.823,
          "en": "later take up the entire available height.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 25.05,
          "end": 26.88,
          "en": "And I'll add a margin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 26.88,
          "end": 28.29,
          "en": "to the top and bottom,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 28.29,
          "end": 31.86,
          "en": "so along the vertical axis of 2rem",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 31.86,
          "end": 34.473,
          "en": "by adding the my-8 class.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 36.57,
          "end": 37.8,
          "en": "With that, I'll move on",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.8,
          "end": 40.803,
          "en": "to the ProjectsSidebar component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 41.97,
          "end": 44.37,
          "en": "And there on this aside element,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 44.37,
          "end": 45.63,
          "en": "I'll also add a bunch",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 45.63,
          "end": 48.063,
          "en": "of classes to style this sidebar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 49.2,
          "end": 51.99,
          "en": "For example I'll give it a width or 1/3",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 51.99,
          "end": 54.09,
          "en": "of the available width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 54.09,
          "end": 56.82,
          "en": "so that's another class provided by Tailwind",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 56.82,
          "end": 60.423,
          "en": "which sets the width to 1/3 of the available width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 61.68,
          "end": 64.08,
          "en": "I'll also add some padding to the left and right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 64.08,
          "end": 66.783,
          "en": "with the px-8 class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 67.83,
          "end": 71.703,
          "en": "and some top/bottom padding with py-16,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.6,
          "end": 74.61,
          "en": "and then give it a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 74.61,
          "end": 78.873,
          "en": "of bg-stone-900, which is a dark gray color.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 80.22,
          "end": 82.65,
          "en": "I'll make sure that the text is still readable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.65,
          "end": 87.57,
          "en": "on that sidebar by setting the text color to text-stone-50,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 87.57,
          "end": 90.963,
          "en": "which is a very light gray color, almost white.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 93.42,
          "end": 94.95,
          "en": "Then I also wanna make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 94.95,
          "end": 98.67,
          "en": "on bigger screens we have a fixed width instead",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.67,
          "end": 103.67,
          "en": "of taking up 1/3, which would lead to a very wide sidebar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 103.89,
          "end": 108.78,
          "en": "and therefore prefixed with this md: prefix here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 108.78,
          "end": 112.17,
          "en": "To add a rule that only applies on bigger screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 112.17,
          "end": 117.17,
          "en": "I'll set the width to 18rem by adding the w-72 rule here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 120.93,
          "end": 123.3,
          "en": "Last but not least, I'll add some rounded corners,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 123.3,
          "end": 124.86,
          "en": "but only on the right side,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.86,
          "end": 129.303,
          "en": "by adding the rounded-r-xl class, like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.56,
          "end": 132.87,
          "en": "This basically sets the border top right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 132.87,
          "end": 134.523,
          "en": "and bottom right radius.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 137.61,
          "end": 139.683,
          "en": "With that, if we save that,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 140.64,
          "end": 143.88,
          "en": "you see that this is how my sidebar looks.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 143.88,
          "end": 146.64,
          "en": "It's not taking up the available height yet,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 146.64,
          "end": 148.383,
          "en": "but that will soon change.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 150.32999999999998,
          "end": 152.01,
          "en": "Now, inside of that sidebar,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 152.01,
          "end": 155.22,
          "en": "that h2 tag should also receive some styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 157.67000000000002,
          "en": "For example, I wanna have a margin to the bottom.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 158.82,
          "end": 162.123,
          "en": "I will add font-bold to make the text bold.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 163.47,
          "end": 166.05,
          "en": "I'll add the uppercase class to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 166.05,
          "end": 170.073,
          "en": "that all characters are transformed to uppercase characters,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.77,
          "end": 173.82,
          "en": "and I'll make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 173.82,
          "end": 176.403,
          "en": "on bigger screens the text is bigger.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 177.87,
          "end": 178.89,
          "en": "Last but not least",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 178.89,
          "end": 182.073,
          "en": "I'll change the color a little bit to another light gray.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 185.16,
          "end": 186.9,
          "en": "And with these glasses added,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 186.9,
          "end": 188.763,
          "en": "this is how my title looks like now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 191.13,
          "end": 195.783,
          "en": "Now for the button here, I'll also add some classes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.71,
          "end": 199.65,
          "en": "because I wanna have some padding to the left and right",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 199.65,
          "end": 202.74,
          "en": "and also some bottom and top padding,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.74,
          "end": 204.573,
          "en": "so along the vertical axis.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 205.92000000000002,
          "end": 209.373,
          "en": "The text should be a bit smaller here with text-xs,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 211.17000000000002,
          "end": 212.7,
          "en": "though on bigger screens,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 212.7,
          "end": 215.61,
          "en": "I want to have the base default text size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 215.61,
          "end": 219.177,
          "en": "by adding the text-base class prefixed with md:.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 221.52,
          "end": 223.68,
          "en": "I'll give this button rounded corners",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.68,
          "end": 227.59,
          "en": "by adding rounded-md as a class here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.68,
          "end": 231.42000000000002,
          "en": "and give it a background color",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 231.42000000000002,
          "end": 234.09,
          "en": "of bg-stone-700,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 234.09,
          "end": 237.363,
          "en": "and a text color of text-stone-400.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 240.54,
          "end": 242.43,
          "en": "Then I also wanna change the look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 242.43,
          "end": 244.53,
          "en": "of this button when we hover over it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 244.53,
          "end": 248.55,
          "en": "by giving it a background color of stone-600 prefixed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 248.55,
          "end": 251.85,
          "en": "with hover to make sure that this class is only applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 251.85,
          "end": 253.953,
          "en": "if we are hovering over the button.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 255.21,
          "end": 259.83,
          "en": "And I'll also change the text color to text-stone-100",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 259.83,
          "end": 261.213,
          "en": "if we hover over it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 264.6,
          "end": 267.66,
          "en": "With that we got a lot of classes on this button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 267.66,
          "end": 269.61,
          "en": "And buttons are very often",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 269.61,
          "end": 273.75,
          "en": "amongst the elements that get the most Tailwind CSS classes.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 273.75,
          "end": 275.31,
          "en": "But with that, we're now also done",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 275.31,
          "end": 277.89300000000003,
          "en": "and we got this nice lovely button here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 279.3,
          "end": 282.017,
          "en": "And now that we do have this basic sidebar",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 282.017,
          "end": 283.83,
          "en": "and this button here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 283.83,
          "end": 285.96,
          "en": "the next step is to make sure",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 285.96,
          "end": 288.45,
          "en": "that this button can be clicked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 288.45,
          "end": 292.2,
          "en": "to then open up a little screen, you could say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 292.2,
          "end": 295.56,
          "en": "so to display a component that allows us",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 295.56,
          "end": 298.293,
          "en": "to enter the details for a new project.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}